{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 2, "text": "杉、松、泡桐等各种木材。楠竹是江河岸边的特产。水中鱼类很多，主要有鲤鱼、青鱼等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 270, "w": 1556, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "杉、松、泡桐等各种木材。楠竹是江河岸边的特产。水中鱼类很多，主要有鲤鱼、青鱼等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 270, "w": 1556, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 3, "text": "密林深山有野猪、獐、狐狸、猴、锦鸡等珍禽异兽。同时，还出产杜仲、五倍子、天麻等名贵", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 334, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "密林深山有野猪、獐、狐狸、猴、锦鸡等珍禽异兽。同时，还出产杜仲、五倍子、天麻等名贵", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 334, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 4, "text": "药材。地下矿藏也很丰富，有金、煤、锑、铁、铝、锌、铅、磷、汞等儿十个品种。黔西南布依", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 398, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "药材。地下矿藏也很丰富，有金、煤、锑、铁、铝、锌、铅、磷、汞等儿十个品种。黔西南布依", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 398, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 5, "text": "族苗族自治州盛产黄金，蕴藏量大，被誉为中国的两个“金三角”之一。", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 459, "w": 1222, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "族苗族自治州盛产黄金，蕴藏量大，被誉为中国的两个“金三角”之一。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 459, "w": 1222, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 6, "text": "第二节 族称、族源", "bbox_px": {"x": 579, "y": 620, "w": 494, "h": 68}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第二节 族称、族源", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 579, "y": 620, "w": 494, "h": 68}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 7, "text": "历史上，对布依族有过各种各样的汉称，如“仲家”、“夷家”、“水户”、“水族”，“本", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 789, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "历史上，对布依族有过各种各样的汉称，如“仲家”、“夷家”、“水户”、“水族”，“本", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 789, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 8, "text": "地”、“土边”", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 853, "w": 221, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "地”、“土边”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 853, "w": 221, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 9, "text": "、“土人”等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 269, "y": 853, "w": 217, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“土人”等。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 269, "y": 853, "w": 217, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 10, "text": "“仲家”之称始于元朝，《元史•地理志》有“栖求（今贵州长顺一带）等处有仲家蛮”", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 913, "w": 1475, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“仲家”之称始于元朝，《元史•地理志》有“栖求（今贵州长顺一带）等处有仲家蛮”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 913, "w": 1475, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 11, "text": "的记载。明、清史籍则称“仲苗”、“仲蛮”、“青仲”或“仲家”，后者沿用至中华人民共和国", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 971, "w": 1541, "h": 74}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "的记载。明、清史籍则称“仲苗”、“仲蛮”、“青仲”或“仲家”，后者沿用至中华人民共和国", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 971, "w": 1541, "h": 74}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 12, "text": "成立初期。在相当长的一段时期内，“仲家”一直被用来作族称。究其原因，一是布依", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1046, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "成立初期。在相当长的一段时期内，“仲家”一直被用来作族称。究其原因，一是布依", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1046, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 13, "text": "族从事水稻种植而被称“种人”或“种家”，", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1110, "w": 728, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "族从事水稻种植而被称“种人”或“种家”，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1110, "w": 728, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 14, "text": "，“种”、“仲”同音，故后称“仲家”；另一说是布", "bbox_px": {"x": 764, "y": 1106, "w": 832, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，“种”、“仲”同音，故后称“仲家”；另一说是布", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 764, "y": 1106, "w": 832, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 15, "text": "依族“相传奉调而来，身穿重甲，因名仲家”。第一种说法有一定道理，第二种说法则显得", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1175, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "依族“相传奉调而来，身穿重甲，因名仲家”。第一种说法有一定道理，第二种说法则显得", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1175, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 16, "text": "牵强附会。从布依族自称来看，“仲家”一称是由古代一部分布依族的自称转化而来的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1239, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "牵强附会。从布依族自称来看，“仲家”一称是由古代一部分布依族的自称转化而来的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1239, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 17, "text": "布依族中，有自称“布仲”的情况。而壮族之得名，也主要源自自称“布壮”［pu*", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1299, "w": 1403, "h": 63}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族中，有自称“布仲”的情况。而壮族之得名，也主要源自自称“布壮”［pu*", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1299, "w": 1403, "h": 63}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 18, "text": "cuan’］。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1451, "y": 1300, "w": 153, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "cuan’］。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 1451, "y": 1300, "w": 153, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 19, "text": "“壮”、“仲”一音之转，壮、布依两个民族有相同的历史渊源，在红水河两岸，同一姓氏分别", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 1368, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“壮”、“仲”一音之转，壮、布依两个民族有相同的历史渊源，在红水河两岸，同一姓氏分别", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 1368, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 20, "text": "属于壮族和布依族的情况很普遍，实际上比邻地区民间存在广泛的民族认同。“夷”之称", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1432, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "属于壮族和布依族的情况很普遍，实际上比邻地区民间存在广泛的民族认同。“夷”之称", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1432, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 21, "text": "呼则更早，始于秦、汉，后又有“夷濮”、“夷僚”之称。故布依族亦被称为“夷家”", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1490, "w": 1400, "h": 70}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "呼则更早，始于秦、汉，后又有“夷濮”、“夷僚”之称。故布依族亦被称为“夷家”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1490, "w": 1400, "h": 70}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 22, "text": "、“夷族”", "bbox_px": {"x": 1443, "y": 1501, "w": 157, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“夷族”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 1443, "y": 1501, "w": 157, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 23, "text": "等。布依族喜傍水而居，善种水稻，故又被称为“水户”", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1565, "w": 973, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等。布依族喜傍水而居，善种水稻，故又被称为“水户”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1565, "w": 973, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 24, "text": "、“水家”、“水族”、“水仲家”等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1021, "y": 1561, "w": 583, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“水家”、“水族”、“水仲家”等。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 1021, "y": 1561, "w": 583, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 25, "text": "至于布依族被称为“本地”", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1629, "w": 462, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "至于布依族被称为“本地”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1629, "w": 462, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 26, "text": "’、“土人”、“土边”，而相对地称汉族为“客家”", "bbox_px": {"x": 499, "y": 1629, "w": 812, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "’、“土人”、“土边”，而相对地称汉族为“客家”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 499, "y": 1629, "w": 812, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
