{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 28, "text": "了布依族先于汉族居住于贵州的史实。中华人民共和国成立后，根据本民族的意愿，", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 1698, "w": 1536, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "了布依族先于汉族居住于贵州的史实。中华人民共和国成立后，根据本民族的意愿，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 1698, "w": 1536, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 29, "text": "1953 年将族称统一力“布依族”", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1758, "w": 547, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "1953 年将族称统一力“布依族”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1758, "w": 547, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 30, "text": "“布依”二字系本民族自称译音，“布”是“人”或“族”的意思；“依”是族名的专称，与", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1823, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“布依”二字系本民族自称译音，“布”是“人”或“族”的意思；“依”是族名的专称，与", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1823, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 31, "text": "“越”是同一个词，发音相同或相近（各土语对布依族自称发音略有差异）。“布依”二字", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1887, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“越”是同一个词，发音相同或相近（各土语对布依族自称发音略有差异）。“布依”二字", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1887, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 32, "text": "与汉文古籍中的“濮”、“越”", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1951, "w": 490, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "与汉文古籍中的“濮”、“越”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1951, "w": 490, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 33, "text": "、“夷”等字有密切的关系。", "bbox_px": {"x": 543, "y": 1951, "w": 458, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "、“夷”等字有密切的关系。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 543, "y": 1951, "w": 458, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 30, "line_no": 34, "text": "布依族的族源，最早可以追溯到远古时期的越人。古代越人分布地域广，支系庞杂，", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2020, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族的族源，最早可以追溯到远古时期的越人。古代越人分布地域广，支系庞杂，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2020, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
